@lang en
IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate

-- Bao Minh, fire and special perils insurance rules: THE NOUNS.
-- DECLARE and nothing else. Every rule module imports this one.
--
-- src:1 | QUY TẮC
-- src:2 | BẢO HIỂM HỎA HOẠN VÀ CÁC RỦI RO ĐẶC BIỆT
-- src:3 | Hợp đồng bảo hiểm số ………………………
--
-- Source: ../../source/raw/baominh-fire.txt, the `pdftotext -layout` rendering of the
-- insurer's PDF (sha256 3a74940c...ae77), retrieved 2026-10-06. A `src:N` comment quotes
-- line N of that file and is generated by tools/vnsrc.py, never typed.
--
-- Money is Vietnamese dong (VND), a bare NUMBER. Days are calendar days and months are
-- calendar months unless a comment says otherwise (NOTES.md, forks F20-F22).
--
-- Membership test for this module: a witness of ordinary competence could testify to the
-- fact, or the Policy Summary, the property list or a claim file records it. Whether the
-- fact makes a loss covered or payable is a rule, and lives in the module for its Part.
--
-- WHAT THE RULES LEAVE TO OTHER DOCUMENTS. The Rules name three documents that together
-- are one contract (condition VI.1): these Rules, the Policy Summary ("Bản tóm lược hợp
-- đồng bảo hiểm") and the property list ("Danh mục tài sản"). Everything the Summary or
-- the list fixes for a particular policy (the period, the risks taken, the sums insured,
-- the deductibles, the premium, the insured locations, any warranty) is an INPUT here,
-- with no default. The contract number ("Hợp đồng bảo hiểm số") is a blank in the Rules
-- and is not modelled.

§ `Nouns`

§§ `The risks of Section II`

-- The ten risks the Rules describe in Section II, A to J. Which of them a policy covers
-- is stated in the Policy Summary (preamble, src:12-13); the Rules themselves insure none.
-- src:28 | II. RỦI RO
-- src:29 | A. CHÁY (do nổ hoặc bất kỳ nguyên nhân nào khác) nhưng loại trừ:
-- src:48 | B. NỔ
-- src:55 | C. MÁY BAY và các phương tiện hàng không khác hoặc thiết bị trên các phương tiện đó
-- src:56 | rơi trúng
-- src:57 | D. GÂY RỐI, ĐÌNH CÔNG, BẾ XƯỞNG, những TỔN HẠI gây ra trực tiếp do
-- src:92 | E. TỔN HẠI DO HÀNH ĐỘNG ÁC Ý:
-- src:103 | F. ĐỘNG ĐẤT HOẶC NÚI LỬA PHUN: bao gồm lũ lụt nước biển do hậu quả của động
-- src:109 | G. GIÔNG VÀ BÃO
-- src:126 | H. GIÔNG, BÃO VÀ LỤT
-- src:139 | I. NƯỚC TRÀN TỪ CÁC BỂ VÀ THIẾT BỊ CHỨA NƯỚC HOẶC ĐƯỜNG ỐNG DẪN
-- src:140 | NƯỚC, nhưng loại trừ:
-- src:150 | J. ĐÂM VA DO XE CỘ HOẶC SÚC VẬT
DECLARE `A risk in Section II` IS ONE OF
    `A. fire, lightning, and explosion of a domestic boiler or gas`  -- CHÁY, SÉT ĐÁNH, NỔ
    `B. explosion`                                                     -- NỔ
    `C. aircraft and other aerial devices`                             -- MÁY BAY
    `D. riot, strike and lockout`                                      -- GÂY RỐI, ĐÌNH CÔNG, BẾ XƯỞNG
    `E. malicious damage`                                              -- HÀNH ĐỘNG ÁC Ý
    `F. earthquake or volcanic eruption`                               -- ĐỘNG ĐẤT HOẶC NÚI LỬA PHUN
    `G. storm and tempest`                                             -- GIÔNG VÀ BÃO
    `H. storm, tempest and flood`                                      -- GIÔNG, BÃO VÀ LỤT
    `I. water from tanks, apparatus or pipes`                          -- NƯỚC TRÀN TỪ CÁC BỂ
    `J. impact by vehicles or animals`                                 -- ĐÂM VA DO XE CỘ HOẶC SÚC VẬT

§§ `The Policy Summary`

-- A deductible ("Mức miễn thường") as the Policy Summary states it for one risk. The
-- Rules state no figure for any deductible; they say only how a stated one is applied
-- (Section IV and the closing paragraph of risks E to J). A risk for which the Summary
-- states no deductible has none to apply. A deductible the Summary states as a
-- percentage is converted to an amount by the caller (NOTES.md, fork F17).
DECLARE `A deductible stated in the Policy Summary` HAS
    `risk`                IS A `A risk in Section II`
    `amount for each loss` IS A NUMBER

-- What the Policy Summary states for this policy. The preamble insures "tài sản được
-- nêu trong Bản tóm lược" against "các rủi ro được ghi trong Bản tóm lược":
-- src:11 | suốt thời hạn bảo hiểm và sau khi đã đóng phí bảo hiểm được yêu cầu, tài sản được nêu trong Bản tóm
-- src:12 | lược hợp đồng bảo hiểm hoặc bộ phận của tài sản đó bị tổn thất, tổn hại, bị phá hủy do các rủi ro được ghi
-- src:13 | trong Bản tóm lược hợp đồng bảo hiểm gây ra.
DECLARE `The Policy Summary` HAS
    `start of the period of insurance`                              IS A DATE
    `end of the period of insurance`                                IS A DATE
    `risks stated as insured`                                       IS A LIST OF `A risk in Section II`
    `total sum insured`                                             IS A NUMBER
    `deductibles stated`                                            IS A LIST OF `A deductible stated in the Policy Summary`
    `premium for the period of insurance`                           IS A NUMBER
    `annual premium`                                                IS A NUMBER
    `rent insured under this policy`                                IS A BOOLEAN
    `Bao Minh agreed to reinstate the sums insured already paid out` IS A BOOLEAN
    `a renewal of an earlier period`                                IS A BOOLEAN

§§ `Insured property`

-- The categories of property that general exclusion III.2(a) names. Everything else is
-- `property of no category named in III.2(a)`.
-- src:186 | 2. (a) Hàng hóa uỷ thác hoặc ký gửi, vàng bạc và đá quý, tiền (giấy hoặc kim loại), séc,
-- src:187 | chứng khoán, giấy ký nợ, tem, tài liệu, bản thảo, sổ sách kinh doanh, hệ thống dữ liệu
-- src:188 | máy tính, vật mẫu, khuôn vẽ, bản thiết kế, chất nổ, trừ khi được ghi nhận là được bảo
-- src:189 | hiểm trong hợp đồng bảo hiểm này;
DECLARE `A category of property` IS ONE OF
    `property of no category named in III.2(a)`
    `goods held in trust or on commission`        -- Hàng hóa uỷ thác hoặc ký gửi
    `gold, silver or precious stones`             -- vàng bạc và đá quý
    `money, in notes or coins`                    -- tiền (giấy hoặc kim loại)
    `cheques`                                     -- séc
    `securities`                                  -- chứng khoán
    `promissory notes`                            -- giấy ký nợ
    `stamps`                                      -- tem
    `documents`                                   -- tài liệu
    `manuscripts`                                 -- bản thảo
    `business books`                              -- sổ sách kinh doanh
    `computer data systems`                       -- hệ thống dữ liệu máy tính
    `samples`                                     -- vật mẫu
    `patterns`                                    -- khuôn vẽ
    `designs`                                     -- bản thiết kế
    `explosives`                                  -- chất nổ

-- One item ("hạng mục tài sản") of insured property, as it stood when the DAMAGE
-- occurred. The average condition and the sum-insured cap work item by item:
-- src:16 | (i) Tổng số tiền bảo hiểm hoặc số tiền bảo hiểm của mỗi hạng mục tài sản bị tổn thất
-- * `stated in the Policy Summary`: the item, or a class it falls in, is in the Summary or
--   the property list (preamble, src:11-12).
-- * `specifically recorded as insured in this policy`: the carve-back of III.2(a), "trừ
--   khi được ghi nhận là được bảo hiểm trong hợp đồng bảo hiểm này" (fork F11).
-- * the next five fields are the facts on which an item-level exclusion turns:
--   G(iii) and H(ii) outdoor property; G(iv) and H(iii) buildings under works; I(ii) an
--   empty building; B(a) the vessel that exploded; VIII.1(b) data media.
-- * `actual value at the time of the DAMAGE` is "trị giá thực tế" (VII.5) and "giá trị
--   tài sản vào thời điểm xảy ra tổn thất" (preamble).
-- * `already paid for earlier losses in this period`: proviso (ii) caps liability at the
--   sum insured remaining after earlier payments.
DECLARE `An item of insured property` HAS
    `description`                                                        IS A STRING
    `stated in the Policy Summary`                                       IS A BOOLEAN
    `category`                                                           IS A `A category of property`
    `specifically recorded as insured in this policy`                    IS A BOOLEAN
    `an awning, blind, signboard, outside fixture, gate, fence, or movable property in the open` IS A BOOLEAN
    `a building under construction, renovation or repair`                IS A BOOLEAN
    `every door, window and other opening completed against storm`       IS A BOOLEAN
    `a building left empty or not in use`                                IS A BOOLEAN
    `the boiler, economiser, vessel, machine or apparatus under pressure that exploded, or an internal part of it` IS A BOOLEAN
    `electronic data processing media`                                   IS A BOOLEAN
    `electrical machinery, apparatus or installation`                    IS A BOOLEAN
    `sum insured`                                                        IS A NUMBER
    `actual value at the time of the DAMAGE`                             IS A NUMBER
    `already paid for earlier losses in this period`                     IS A NUMBER

§§ `What was lost`

-- The kinds of loss the Rules distinguish. Only the first is what the insuring clause
-- promises ("bị tổn thất, tổn hại, bị phá hủy", src:12); the others are named in order
-- to be excluded (D.2, III.3, VIII.1, VIII.2), or, for rent, written back (III.3).
DECLARE `A head of loss` IS ONE OF
    `physical loss, destruction or damage`
    `loss of income, delay, loss of market, or other consequential or indirect loss`  -- D.2(a), III.3
    `loss of rent`                                                                    -- III.3 carve-back
    `loss from stopping or interrupting work, a process or an operation`              -- D.2(b)
    `loss of possession by confiscation or requisition by order of a lawful authority` -- D.2(c)
    `loss of possession of a building by unlawful occupation`                         -- D.2(d)
    `loss of or damage to electronic data, or loss of use or cost resulting from it`  -- VIII.1(a)(i)
    `cost of altering or modifying a computer system, program or chip`                -- VIII.2 Part 2

-- Other insurance covering the same item (VII.6), and whether that policy carries a
-- clause by which it does not pay, or pays only rateably, alongside this one.
DECLARE `Other insurance on the item` HAS
    `its sum insured for the item`                                IS A NUMBER
    `it excludes or rateably limits its share alongside this policy` IS A BOOLEAN

-- One claimed loss: an item, what happened to it, and the figures the measure needs.
-- * `destroyed`: the preamble pays "giá trị tài sản vào thời điểm xảy ra tổn thất hoặc
--   hủy hoại" for a destroyed item, and "số tiền thiệt hại" otherwise.
-- * `caused by fire`: risk F applies its deductible only to losses "không phải do cháy".
-- * the rain and water fields: G(v) and H(iv).
-- * `caused by theft, robbery or attempted theft`: E and III.4.
-- * the three "the item ..." fields under A(b): fork F5 (they are read item by item).
-- * `the item itself suffered ...`: III.1(c), which reaches only the machine "bị ảnh
--   hưởng trực tiếp".
-- * the marine fields: III.2(b).
-- * `cost of restoring the item ...`: VII.3, what Bao Minh pays where it elects to repair
--   or replace, or is prevented by local regulations.
-- * the three media fields: VIII.1(b).
DECLARE `A claimed loss` HAS
    `item`                                                         IS AN `An item of insured property`
    `head of loss`                                                 IS A `A head of loss`
    `destroyed`                                                    IS A BOOLEAN
    `amount of the damage`                                         IS A NUMBER
    `caused by fire`                                               IS A BOOLEAN
    `caused by rain`                                               IS A BOOLEAN
    `caused by water other than rain`                              IS A BOOLEAN
    `the rain or water came in through an opening in the structure made by the direct force of the storm` IS A BOOLEAN
    `caused by theft, robbery or attempted theft`                  IS A BOOLEAN
    `the item fermented, heated or burned of itself`               IS A BOOLEAN
    `the item was undergoing a drying process or a process using heat` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the item was burned by order of a public authority`           IS A BOOLEAN
    `the item itself suffered over-running, excessive pressure, short-circuiting, self-heating, arcing or leakage of electricity` IS A BOOLEAN
    `insured, or but for this policy would be insured, under a marine policy` IS A BOOLEAN
    `amount recoverable under the marine policy`                   IS A NUMBER
    `other insurance`                                              IS A MAYBE `Other insurance on the item`
    `cost of restoring the item to its condition before the loss`  IS A NUMBER
    `cost of blank media`                                          IS A NUMBER
    `cost of copying the data from back-up or from originals`      IS A NUMBER
    `the media were repaired, replaced or restored`                IS A BOOLEAN

-- The claimed losses at one place. "TỔN HẠI" is damage "tại địa điểm được bảo hiểm"
-- (definition I, src:20-21), and several deductibles apply "ở mỗi địa điểm".
DECLARE `The loss at one location` HAS
    `location`                                    IS A STRING
    `an insured location stated in the Policy Summary` IS A BOOLEAN
    `claimed losses`                              IS A LIST OF `A claimed loss`

§§ `The incident`

-- What happened, as facts a loss adjuster or a witness could state. Each field is the
-- fact one limb of the Rules turns on; the clause is given beside it. Fields that take
-- the source's own words in two places (II.D and III.1(a)) are kept apart word by word,
-- because the Rules use different words for what may be the same event (finding X3).
DECLARE `The facts of the incident` HAS
    -- definition I, "Cháy" (src:22-23)
    `an actual flame`                                                     IS A BOOLEAN
    `the flame was out of control`                                        IS A BOOLEAN
    `the flame burned in abnormal conditions`                             IS A BOOLEAN
    `the flame was a fire source meant for everyday living`                IS A BOOLEAN
    -- definition I, "Khủng bố" (src:24-27), and its narrower use in B(b) and D.1(a)
    `violence or force was used or threatened`                            IS A BOOLEAN
    `for a political, religious, ideological or similar purpose`          IS A BOOLEAN
    `by persons acting on behalf of or in connection with an organisation` IS A BOOLEAN
    -- risk A
    `an earthquake or volcanic eruption`                                  IS A BOOLEAN  -- A(a), A explosion, F
    `another convulsion of nature`                                        IS A BOOLEAN  -- A(a), A explosion
    `an underground fire`                                                 IS A BOOLEAN  -- A(b)(iv)
    `a forest, bush, grassland, wilderness or jungle fire, or the burning of land to clear it` IS A BOOLEAN  -- A(c)
    `a direct lightning strike`                                           IS A BOOLEAN
    `the lightning changed the shape of the property or set it alight`    IS A BOOLEAN
    `an explosion`                                                        IS A BOOLEAN  -- A, B
    `the explosion was of a boiler or of gas`                             IS A BOOLEAN
    `the boiler or gas was used for domestic purposes`                    IS A BOOLEAN
    `at a place whose function includes producing gas`                    IS A BOOLEAN
    -- risk C
    `an aircraft or other aerial device, or something from one, fell on the property` IS A BOOLEAN
    -- risk D, (a) to (d), and its exclusions
    `an act of a person taking part with others in disturbing public order` IS A BOOLEAN
    `action of a lawful authority suppressing or limiting such a disturbance` IS A BOOLEAN
    `a wilful act of a striker or locked-out worker, to further a strike or resist a lockout` IS A BOOLEAN
    `action of a lawful authority preventing or limiting the consequences of such acts` IS A BOOLEAN
    `a civil commotion that is part of, or grows into, a popular uprising` IS A BOOLEAN  -- D.1(b)
    `a malicious act of any person`                                       IS A BOOLEAN  -- D.1(c), E
    `the malicious act was a wilful act of strikers, demonstrators or locked-out workers, to further a strike or resist a lockout` IS A BOOLEAN  -- D.1(c)
    `malicious erasure, loss, distortion or corruption of information on a computer system or in software, programs or stored data` IS A BOOLEAN  -- D.1(d)
    `the damage occurred while the Insured was permanently dispossessed by confiscation or requisition` IS A BOOLEAN  -- D.2(c) with its proviso
    `the damage occurred while the Insured was permanently dispossessed of a building by unlawful occupation` IS A BOOLEAN  -- D.2(d) with its proviso
    -- risk F
    `a flood of sea water resulting from an earthquake or volcanic eruption` IS A BOOLEAN
    -- risks G and H
    `a storm or tempest`                                                  IS A BOOLEAN
    `a flood`                                                             IS A BOOLEAN
    `water overflowing from a natural or artificial water source, reservoir, canal, dam, or water apparatus or pipe` IS A BOOLEAN  -- G(i)(a)
    `a flood from the sea`                                                IS A BOOLEAN  -- G(i)(b)
    `frost, subsidence or landslip`                                       IS A BOOLEAN  -- G(ii), H(i)
    -- risk I, and H(v)
    `water overflowing from a water tank, water apparatus or water pipe`  IS A BOOLEAN
    `leakage or discharge from an automatic sprinkler installation`       IS A BOOLEAN  -- I(i)
    -- risk J
    `impact by a vehicle`                                                 IS A BOOLEAN
    `impact by an animal`                                                 IS A BOOLEAN
    `the vehicle or animal was owned or controlled by the Insured, the occupier of the insured premises, or their employees` IS A BOOLEAN
    -- general exclusion III.1(a); the words are the source's, kept apart (finding X3)
    `a riot or rebellion, the event III.1(a)(i) and III.1(a)(iii) both name`  IS A BOOLEAN  -- "Nổi loạn"
    `a civil commotion`                                                   IS A BOOLEAN  -- "bạo động dân sự"
    `a strike or lockout`                                                 IS A BOOLEAN  -- "bãi công, bế xưởng"
    `war, invasion, act of a foreign enemy, hostilities or warlike operations, or civil war` IS A BOOLEAN  -- III.1(a)(ii)
    `a violent disturbance, the further event III.1(a)(iii) names`       IS A BOOLEAN  -- "bạo động"
    `mutiny, popular rising, insurrection, revolution, coup, martial law, or events leading to martial law or curfew` IS A BOOLEAN  -- III.1(a)(iii)
    -- general exclusion III.1(b) and (d)
    `nuclear weapons material`                                            IS A BOOLEAN
    `ionising radiation or radioactive contamination from nuclear fuel or nuclear waste` IS A BOOLEAN
    `pollution or contamination`                                          IS A BOOLEAN
    `the pollution or contamination itself resulted from an insured risk` IS A BOOLEAN
    `an insured risk itself resulted from the pollution or contamination` IS A BOOLEAN
    -- claims condition VII.1(a)(iii)
    `the damage was done by a deliberate act or by sabotage`              IS A BOOLEAN
    -- special endorsement VIII.2, Part 1 (a) and (b)
    `a computer or chip's handling of a date change, including year 2000 or a leap year, contributed` IS A BOOLEAN
    `a change or modification relating to a date change contributed`      IS A BOOLEAN

§§ `The Insured's conduct`

-- What the Insured did, before and after the DAMAGE, as a claim file records it. Each
-- field is the fact a condition turns on. "Ngay lập tức" (VII.1(a)) is not a number of
-- days; whether the Insured acted at once is a finding of fact (fork F20).
DECLARE `The Insured's conduct` HAS
    `misdeclared, misdescribed, gave untrue information, or did not disclose material information about the insured risk` IS A BOOLEAN  -- VI.2
    `kept the insured property in good repair and took every proper measure to prevent DAMAGE` IS A BOOLEAN  -- VI.6
    `took steps at once to minimise the loss and recover lost property` IS A BOOLEAN  -- VII.1(a)(i)
    `notified Bao Minh in writing at once`                             IS A BOOLEAN  -- VII.1(a)(ii)
    `notified the police at once`                                      IS A BOOLEAN  -- VII.1(a)(iii)
    `date the written claim was delivered`                             IS A DATE     -- VII.1(b)
    `a longer period for the written claim allowed by Bao Minh in writing, in days` IS A MAYBE NUMBER  -- VII.1(b)
    `supplied at its own expense the information and documents Bao Minh reasonably required, with a sworn statement` IS A BOOLEAN  -- VII.1, closing paragraph
    `supplied the plans and information Bao Minh asked for to repair or replace` IS A BOOLEAN  -- VII.3
    `did what Bao Minh required to enforce rights against third parties` IS A BOOLEAN  -- VII.7
    `the claim was fraudulent`                                         IS A BOOLEAN  -- VII.2(a)
    `the Insured, or anyone on its behalf, used fraudulent means to benefit under the policy` IS A BOOLEAN  -- VII.2(a)
    `the DAMAGE was caused by a wilful act, or with the connivance, of the Insured` IS A BOOLEAN  -- VII.2(a)
    `insured the deductible during the period of the policy`           IS A BOOLEAN  -- IV, the warranty

-- A warranty ("đoan kết") the Policy Summary or an endorsement attaches to property.
-- The Rules state none of their own except the one in Section IV, which is a field of
-- `The Insured's conduct`.
DECLARE `A warranty` HAS
    `description`                                    IS A STRING
    `not complied with during the period of insurance` IS A BOOLEAN

§§ `Changes under condition VI.3`

-- src:224 | 3. Thay đổi và di chuyển
-- src:225 | Trong bất kỳ trường hợp nào dưới đây, hợp đồng bảo hiểm sẽ chấm dứt hiệu lực đối với những tài
-- src:226 | sản bị tổn thất trừ khi Người được bảo hiểm, trước khi TỔN HẠI xảy ra, đã được sự chấp thuận
-- src:227 | của Bảo Minh bằng một điều khoản sửa đổi bổ sung do Bảo Minh hoặc người đại diện của Bảo
-- src:228 | Minh cấp:
DECLARE `A kind of change under condition VI.3` IS ONE OF
    `a change of trade or occupation, or another change, affecting the insured building or the insured property in it and increasing the likelihood of DAMAGE by an insured risk`  -- (a)
    `the insured building, or the building holding insured property, left empty`  -- (b)
    `insured property moved to a building or location other than the one stated`  -- (c)
    `the interest in insured property passed from the Insured to another, otherwise than by will or by operation of law`  -- (d)

DECLARE `A change under condition VI.3` HAS
    `kind`                                                  IS A `A kind of change under condition VI.3`
    `date it began`                                         IS A DATE
    `Bao Minh consented by an endorsement before the DAMAGE` IS A BOOLEAN

§§ `Premium`

-- Special endorsement VIII.3, the premium payment warranty. "Ngày chấp nhận bảo hiểm"
-- (the date cover was accepted) is the anchor of its thirty days (fork F28).
DECLARE `An instalment of premium` HAS
    `agreed date`  IS A DATE
    `date paid`    IS A MAYBE DATE

DECLARE `The premium` HAS
    `date cover was accepted`                         IS A DATE
    `Bao Minh accepted payment in instalments`        IS A BOOLEAN
    `date the premium was paid in full`               IS A MAYBE DATE
    `instalments`                                     IS A LIST OF `An instalment of premium`
    `an agreed premium payment term, in days`         IS A MAYBE NUMBER

-- An endorsement ("Sửa đổi bổ sung") issued with the policy that extends its cover.
DECLARE `An endorsement` HAS
    `date of issue`                    IS A DATE
    `date its cover takes effect`      IS A DATE
    `date its premium was paid in full` IS A MAYBE DATE

§§ `The claim`

-- One claim: one incident, under one risk, at one or more locations.
DECLARE `The claim` HAS
    `Policy Summary`                                   IS A `The Policy Summary`
    `risk claimed under`                               IS A `A risk in Section II`
    `date of the DAMAGE`                               IS A DATE
    `facts`                                            IS A `The facts of the incident`
    `losses`                                           IS A LIST OF `The loss at one location`
    `premium`                                          IS A `The premium`
    `endorsements relied on`                           IS A LIST OF `An endorsement`
    `changes under condition VI.3`                     IS A LIST OF `A change under condition VI.3`
    `warranties`                                       IS A LIST OF `A warranty`
    `conduct`                                          IS A `The Insured's conduct`
    `Bao Minh elected to repair or replace`            IS A BOOLEAN
    `total already paid for earlier losses in this period` IS A NUMBER

§§ `A pending sale`

-- Section V: property sold under a signed contract whose formalities were not complete
-- when the DAMAGE occurred.
-- src:206 | THAY ĐỔI QUYỀN LỢI BẢO HIỂM
DECLARE `A pending sale of insured property` HAS
    `contract of sale signed before the DAMAGE, formalities not complete` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the sale formalities have since been completed`                     IS A BOOLEAN
    `the buyer's benefit would prejudice the obligations or rights of the Insured or of Bao Minh` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the buyer, or its representative, has insured the property`         IS A BOOLEAN
